Position Description
The Finance Coordinator (FC) will support the Finance and Operations Manager/Finance and Administrative Manager in the overall financial management of all donor activities such as participation in annual budgeting process for the organization, preparation of project budgets and budget versus actual analysis. He/She will support in the preparation of cash flow and cash flow management, support in the implementation of audit management feedback, support in preparations of all donor and management financial reporting. He/She will directly liaise with PWC in the day to day accounting records and book keeping activities ensuring the organization receives value for money in service delivery. He/She will supervise other junior finance staff such as Finance Officers and Assistants. He/She will support in ensuring fully implementations of all compliance related feedback. He/She will be a focal point for vendor relationship management ensuring a regular feedback on donor payments and funds acknowledgment.
Reporting and Supervision:
Reporting
The Finance Coordinator will report to the Finance and Administrative Manager .
Supervision
The Finance Coordinator will supervise the Finance Officer .
Key Responsibilities
Working closely with the PWC Representatives in ensuring timely and accurate recording of transactions in the QuickBooks accounting system;
