Support the FOM/FAM in ensuring internal control systems to mitigate financial mismanagement;
Working closely with PWC in ensuring a regular monthly bank reconciliations are prepared and approved for documentation;
Work closely with the POS vendor service delivery to ensure a regular compliance to the terms of service agreement and ensuring that all liquidations meets expectation;
Support the FOM/FAM in a regular training of the team on internal financial procedures;
Other duties as assigned on an ad hoc basis by the FOM/FAM.
Job Requirement
ICAN/ACCA/CPA or other recognized professional accounting qualification is a must;
